{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"She would stand there, hands on her hips, watching the snapped stems sway in the breeze, usually getting less angry as the years went by. I remember she’d click her tongue, a sharp, rhythmic sound that seemed to accompany the wind, and instead of calling for a shovel or a gun, she’d just let them eat. There was a time when I thought she forgot the garden existed, but one August afternoon, I saw her sitting on the step with a cool bottle of water, gesturing toward a particularly lush patch of green near the corner post. I took a bite, and the sweetness exploded on my tongue, gritty and bright. She didn’t plant them for us, I realized; she planted them to see if the fence held, and the rabbits were merely the first to test its strength.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461448,"id":"chatcmpl-18e01a30d90a60c2007b","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,